WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Let's hold hands, Penelope.

2
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Yippee, yippee!

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I'm going out to a walk!

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Penelope is going out for a walk with her mom and dad.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Are you ready to go?

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Yes!

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Oh, wait, Penelope.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
What is it, mom?

9
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Let's leave Max at home.

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
You might leave him behind somewhere.

11
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
But I will be careful. I won't forget Max.

12
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
But you'll be upset if you lose him.

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
I want to take Max with me.

14
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
He's always with me when I sleep.

15
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
And when I eat meals.

16
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Ah, wait a minute.

17
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.000
I've got an idea.

18
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.000
I'm a dear Penelope.

19
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.000
I want to know what I do, she has.

20
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Can you guess?

21
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
If I put Max in my hat...

22
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Mom and dad won't know.

23
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Oh, she'll know.

24
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.000
I demand my jumper.

25
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.000
I can tell mom and dad that my tummy is too big, because I ate too much.

26
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Maybe it's a good idea to put to me my trouser pockets.

27
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Then my bottom won't touch when I get on the swings.

28
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.000
That's what I'll do.

29
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.000
Well, let's go Penelope.

30
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Oh, mom.

31
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Yes.

32
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.000
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

33
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Be careful darling.

34
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Yes, mom.

35
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Oh, a puzzle.

36
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Wow, it's fun.

37
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.000
Oh, dear Penelope.

38
00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Your shoes will get old, Muddy.

39
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.000
Look, let's hold hands.

40
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.000
With me too.

41
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Yes.

42
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:58.000
Oh, I want to get Muddy.

43
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.000
What is it, Penelope?

44
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Nothing.

45
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.000
I can't climb a tree holding hands.

46
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.000
It's no fun.

47
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Yes, I've got an idea.

48
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Oh dear, Penelope has another idea.

49
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.000
I wonder what it is this time.

50
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.000
If Max takes my place,

51
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.000
I bet Mum and Dad won't notice,

52
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:28.000
and they'll think that it's me.

53
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.000
Then I can have lots of fun.

54
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.000
You pee, you pee.

55
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.000
You pee.

56
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.000
You pee.

57
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.000
Wow.

58
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.000
It's fun.

59
00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.000
It's Muddy.

60
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.000
You pee.

61
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:01.000
Now I'll wipe my trousers and shoes with my scarf,

62
00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.000
and there will be all clean,

63
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.000
and Mum and Dad won't notice.

64
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.000
It's so good.

65
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.000
What's the matter, Penelope?

66
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.000
I have a very good, wonderful idea.

67
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.000
Wonderful idea.

68
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.000
Will you share it?

69
00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.000
It's a secret.

70
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.000
You've had a lot of funny ideas today.

71
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.000
Haven't you, Penelope?

